Generic single-database configuration for Enterprise DaaS Governance Portal.

## Create a new migration

After modifying models in app/models.py or app/models_extended.py:

```bash
cd backend
alembic revision --autogenerate -m "description of changes"
```

## Apply migrations

```bash
alembic upgrade head
```

## Rollback migrations

```bash
# Rollback one version
alembic downgrade -1

# Rollback to specific version
alembic downgrade <revision_id>
```

## View migration history

```bash
alembic history
alembic current
```

## Initial setup

The initial migration should be created after all models are defined:

```bash
alembic revision --autogenerate -m "initial schema"
alembic upgrade head
```
